        "value": "<ul style=\"margin-top: 0cm;\" type=\"disc\">\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\">Reduces Stress by half (rounded down).</li>\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\">Inflicts a <strong>-1 penalty</strong> to all Agility-based rolls for 1 turn.</li>\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\">Cancels the effects of DeKompress. Re-administering DeKompress requires <strong>1 shift</strong> to take effect again.</li>\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\">Causes loss of short memory, you don&rsquo;t remember receiving the dose.</li>\n</ul>",
